title: "Pyruvate partitioning and lactylation writer/eraser machinery in colorectal cancer: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and intermediate results reproducing all reported correlations
  in a multi-cohort systems analysis of pyruvate partitioning and the histone
  lactylation writer/eraser machinery across bulk, single-cell and spatial
  transcriptomic layers in colorectal cancer.
type: software
